{
  "$comment": "Style presets. Each maps Shine design tokens (--sh-*) to the values templates write into builder design fields, so a template looks the same with or without Shine loaded. Font values are the builder built-in font keys: inter, montserrat, jost, playfair, cormorant, cinzel.",
